meta {
  name: Get Recommended Recipes
  type: http
  seq: 70
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/recipes/recommended?code={{functionKey}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  # Get Recommended Recipes
  
  Retrieves recipe recommendations based on household members' ratings and preferences.
  Recommendations are weighted by each member's weight setting.
  
  ## Authentication
  Requires a valid JWT token in the Authorization header (Bearer token).
  
  ## Response Fields
  Array of recommended recipes:
  - `id` (guid): Recipe identifier
  - `title` (string): Recipe name
  - `description` (string): Recipe description
  - `cuisineType` (string): Type of cuisine
  - `averageRating` (decimal): Average rating across all users
  - `householdScore` (decimal): Weighted score based on household members' ratings
  - `imageUrl` (string): URL to recipe image
  
  ## Algorithm
  Recipes are scored based on:
  1. Individual member ratings (weighted by member weight)
  2. Cuisine preferences inferred from past ratings
  3. Recency of last time the recipe was used
  
  ## Error Responses
  - `401 Unauthorized`: Invalid or missing authentication token
}
